    "claim": "The closest calls without a failure, by the near-miss score the search used, were on 096988dd with the car 1 s earlier at 1.5x, on 19f339ba with the ego at 1.4x, and on 023b7fcc with the car 0.5 s earlier at 1.25x. These are the next candidates, as the brief ranks near misses next.",
